1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,363
Diwali se pehle har Indian ghar mein ek alag hi war shuru hota hai — safaai war!

2
00:00:04,383 --> 00:00:07,972
Pankhe, almaari, chhat ke kone, purane akhbaar... sab ek hi hafte mein.

3
00:00:07,992 --> 00:00:09,472
Par kyun?

4
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:13,205
Maana jaata hai ki Maa Lakshmi saaf-suthre, roshan ghar mein hi aati hain.

5
00:00:13,225 --> 00:00:17,230
Isliye ghar ko unke swagat ke liye chamkaaya jaata hai — purana hatao, naya laao.

6
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:21,047
Aur iske peeche ek practical wajah bhi hai, jo aapki deewaron pe dikhti hai.

7
00:00:21,067 --> 00:00:23,280
Diwali monsoon ke thik baad aati hai —

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,638
barsaat ki seelan, deewaron pe fungus, kono mein jaale aur keede.

9
00:00:26,658 --> 00:00:30,122
Toh mausam badalte hi safaai aur rang-rogan karna practical bhi hai.

10
00:00:30,142 --> 00:00:33,272
Yahi saal ka bada reset bhi tha — nayi fasal, nayi shuruaat.

11
00:00:33,292 --> 00:00:35,713
Aapke ghar mein safaai ka captain kaun hai?

12
00:00:35,733 --> 00:00:38,655
Share karo uske sath aur subscribe karo Whysplained ko!
